{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Eaves</i></strong> is an ancient-style scenery-building game. In level mode, you can easily recreate various ancient paintings, architecture, and even poetic scenes while unlocking unique related tiles. In creative mode, you can freely arrange unlocked resources to build your own unique ancient-style world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Level Mode</i> - An Electronic Gallery of Chinese Culture</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eaves transforms famous paintings, historical architecture, poetry, and more into interactive level scenes, presented in the form of 3D line drawings. Players complete the scenes by dragging and dropping tiles into their correct positions. Successfully placing a tile triggers its unique interactive effects, allowing you to complete levels in a relaxing and stress-free atmosphere while unlocking a wide variety of interesting and distinctive tiles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Line Art Scene - The Outline of Cultural Memory</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/aee9251cc81829c85a91023633efe209.poster.avif?t=1771560476\" width=1080 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/aee9251cc81829c85a91023633efe209.webm?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/aee9251cc81829c85a91023633efe209.mp4?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Tile Resources - A History Museum of Edutainment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/1b149f0b9d68e8e7f0906efb83c2a1c8.webp?t=1771560476\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/1b149f0b9d68e8e7f0906efb83c2a1c8.poster.avif?t=1771560476\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1080 height=564 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag-and-Drop Placement - A Stress-Free Re-creation Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/52644a984ed87f2263cf3e05b1388a93.poster.avif?t=1771560476\" width=1080 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/52644a984ed87f2263cf3e05b1388a93.webm?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/52644a984ed87f2263cf3e05b1388a93.mp4?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile Placement Effects - Vivid and Soothing Cultural Interaction</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/c23f0314a4a831293a293fb807b67e3f.poster.avif?t=1771560476\" width=1080 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/c23f0314a4a831293a293fb807b67e3f.webm?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/c23f0314a4a831293a293fb807b67e3f.mp4?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recreate Scenes - Unlock Unique Tile Resources</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/858fa11103a73de0ccc315bc3a984cd5.poster.avif?t=1771560476\" width=1170 height=644 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/858fa11103a73de0ccc315bc3a984cd5.webm?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/858fa11103a73de0ccc315bc3a984cd5.mp4?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Mode - <i>A Completely Free Ancient-Style Canvas</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Creative Mode, you have the freedom to place a vast collection of tiles and build your own ancient-style world exactly as you imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/bafd757880bfdd57500131a438288dfa.poster.avif?t=1771560476\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/bafd757880bfdd57500131a438288dfa.webm?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/bafd757880bfdd57500131a438288dfa.mp4?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Variety of Tiles</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Tile Controls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parameterized Special Components</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop-Motion Style Animation Components</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Canvas Space</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u3010TODO\u3011</i>Interactive Special Modules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, various special modules will be developed with interactive features, bringing the ancient world of Chongyan to life!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1897300?t=1771560476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/fc19ad3c867a0ea61ee2934dca761da16b90e227/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771560476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/512a0cfaa7118a0f97e2bc250c9b3b802f87fe3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771560476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/512a0cfaa7118a0f97e2bc250c9b3b802f87fe3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771560476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3436910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/c33de04bd3e45d54e1a5bdcaf879b8ef.avif?t=1771560476\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Eaves</i></strong> is an ancient-style scenery-building game. In level mode, you can easily recreate various ancient paintings, architecture, and even poetic scenes while unlocking unique related tiles. In creative mode, you can freely arrange unlocked resources to build your own unique ancient-style world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Level Mode</i> - An Electronic Gallery of Chinese Culture</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eaves transforms famous paintings, historical architecture, poetry, and more into interactive level scenes, presented in the form of 3D line drawings. Players complete the scenes by dragging and dropping tiles into their correct positions. Successfully placing a tile triggers its unique interactive effects, allowing you to complete levels in a relaxing and stress-free atmosphere while unlocking a wide variety of interesting and distinctive tiles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Line Art Scene - The Outline of Cultural Memory</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/aee9251cc81829c85a91023633efe209.poster.avif?t=1771560476\" width=1080 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/aee9251cc81829c85a91023633efe209.webm?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/aee9251cc81829c85a91023633efe209.mp4?t=1771560476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Tile Resources - A History Museum of Edutainment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/1b149f0b9d68e8e7f0906efb83c2a1c8.webp?t=1771560476\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897300/extras/1b149f0b9d68e8e7f0906efb83c2a1c8.poster.avif?t=1771560476\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1080 height=564 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag-and-Drop Placement - A Stress-Free Re-creation Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\